72 742 Td
(  inserting records.) Tj
T*
(- Validation: Invalid dates are rejected with descriptive SweetAlert messages, and HTML tags) Tj
T*
(  are removed prior to persistence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(V-07: Hard-Coded Database Credentials and Silent Failures) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Category: Configuration Management) Tj
T*
(- Original risk: Database connection files hard-coded root credentials and suppressed errors,) Tj
T*
(  making environment-specific deployments brittle and hiding outages.) Tj
T*
(- Remediation: Connections now read DB_HOST, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, and DB_NAME from) Tj
T*
(  environment variables, enable MYSQLI_REPORT_ERROR, and abort gracefully with HTTP 500 on) Tj
T*
(  failure while logging the error.) Tj
T*
(- Validation: Tested by temporarily providing an invalid password and observed a controlled) Tj
T*
(  failure with an error log entry instead of a blank page.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Google OAuth 2.0 Integration) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A new /oauth/google-login.php endpoint initiates the Authorization Code flow against Google’s) Tj
T*
(OpenID Connect provider. The callback exchanges the authorization code for tokens, validates) Tj
T*
(state, and provisions or links local accounts using the users.oauth_provider and) Tj
T*
(users.oauth_subject columns. Sessions are regenerated post-login, and users without local) Tj
T*
(passwords are prompted to sign in exclusively via Google to reduce password sprawl. Configure) Tj
T*
(the following environment variables before deploying:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID) Tj
T*
(- GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET) Tj
T*
(- GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI \(optional; auto-derived if omitted\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Validation and Testing Evidence) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- php -l executed on all modified PHP entry points \(admin and customer flows\) to ensure syntax) Tj
T*
(  integrity.) Tj
T*
(- Functional smoke tests covered registration, password upgrade from legacy MD5, booking) Tj
T*
(  submission with valid and invalid dates, and OAuth login using a Google test tenant.) Tj
T*
(- Manual review of browser developer tools confirmed secure cookie attributes and CSRF token) Tj
T*
(  presence on forms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Residual Risks and Future Enhancements) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- File uploads for vehicle images remain minimally validated; deploy-side antivirus scanning) Tj
ET
endstream

